{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":8559544,"ns":0,"title":"Flexible shaft","extract":"A flexible shaft, often referred to as a flex shaft, is a device for transmitting rotary motion between two objects which are not fixed relative to one another. It consists of a rotating wire rope or coil which is flexible but has some torsional stiffness.","description":"Cable for transmitting rotation in any direction","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}